{% comment %}
  KRAMSAKON — image slot with a labelled mockup placeholder.

  Guideline §0 / §4.4: every image area on this store is a placeholder at a
  fixed aspect ratio until the owner drops in final photography. The label is
  real DOM text and the ratio is enforced by CSS, so nothing shifts when the
  photo lands, and no text is ever baked into an image (§3).

  Accepts:
  - image:      {Object}  Shopify image object. Blank -> placeholder renders.
  - ratio:      {String}  CSS aspect-ratio value, e.g. '3 / 2'. Default '3 / 2'.
  - label:      {String}  What the owner should put here, e.g.
                          'Indigo vat, natural daylight'. Shown in the
                          placeholder only.
  - alt:        {String}  Alt text for the real image. Falls back to the alt
                          set on the image in Shopify admin.
  - sizes:      {String}  `sizes` attribute. Default '100vw'.
  - widths:     {String}  srcset widths. Default a wide responsive set.
  - class:      {String}  Extra classes on the wrapper.
  - preload:    {Boolean} true for above-the-fold images (hero LCP).
  - loading:    {String}  'eager' or 'lazy'. Default 'lazy'.

  Usage:
    {% render 'kram-image-mockup',
        image: section.settings.image,
        ratio: '16 / 7',
        label: section.settings.image_label,
        alt: section.settings.image_alt,
        preload: true %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign kram_ratio = ratio | default: '3 / 2'
  assign kram_sizes = sizes | default: '100vw'
  assign kram_widths = widths | default: '375, 550, 750, 1100, 1500, 1780, 2000, 3000'
  assign kram_loading = loading | default: 'lazy'
  assign kram_alt = alt | default: image.alt | default: ''
  assign kram_label = label | default: 'Add your photograph here.'
-%}

<div
  class="kram-media kram-media--ratio{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  style="--kram-ratio: {{ kram_ratio }};"
>
  {%- if image != blank -%}
    {{
      image
      | image_url: width: 3000
      | image_tag:
        widths: kram_widths,
        sizes: kram_sizes,
        alt: kram_alt,
        loading: kram_loading,
        preload: preload,
        class: 'kram-media__image'
    }}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Decorative-by-necessity: there is no image to describe yet. The brief for
      the owner is exposed as text, and screen readers skip the empty frame.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="kram-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="kram-placeholder__tag">[OWNER INPUT] — Image</span>
      <p class="kram-placeholder__label">{{ kram_label }}</p>
      <span class="kram-placeholder__ratio">{{ kram_ratio | replace: ' ', '' | replace: '/', ' : ' }}</span>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
